{"4182770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost in Voice", "steam_appid": 4182770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4210990], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182770/extras/136b88e835f6b44622cf9dff45fecc45.poster.avif?t=1777046455\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182770/extras/136b88e835f6b44622cf9dff45fecc45.webm?t=1777046455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182770/extras/136b88e835f6b44622cf9dff45fecc45.mp4?t=1777046455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Can you trust what you see, when your mind is breaking?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >John Hale is a struggling musician, a husband and a father, barely holding his life together. As reality begins to fracture, John finds himself slipping in and out of the real world and a darker reflection shaped by his own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182770/extras/e15560905d47dace89608a3f184f12dd.poster.avif?t=1777046455\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182770/extras/e15560905d47dace89608a3f184f12dd.webm?t=1777046455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182770/extras/e15560905d47dace89608a3f184f12dd.mp4?t=1777046455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Non‑linear story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in Voice throws you into a captivating non‑linear story experience. Is it the future, past, present, or a fragment of John's shattered mind you're in?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182770/extras/ce3301a3070b9f4e48b93380c041d93e.poster.avif?t=1777046455\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182770/extras/ce3301a3070b9f4e48b93380c041d93e.webm?t=1777046455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182770/extras/ce3301a3070b9f4e48b93380c041d93e.mp4?t=1777046455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Psychological horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark echoes of suppressed memories and the faint glow of one's own sanity leading you to a false self. Where am I? Where is John?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182770/extras/80943e0158bb3c6d6199d308f5f6b016.poster.avif?t=1777046455\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182770/extras/80943e0158bb3c6d6199d308f5f6b016.webm?t=1777046455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182770/extras/80943e0158bb3c6d6199d308f5f6b016.mp4?t=1777046455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Immersive sound design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every noise and voice line is handcrafted to push you to the edge of your seat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted lo